=========================================================================================================
18_karimova_audit.py — Audit of the original deep network: reproduction, leakage ladder and shared-fold comparison
=========================================================================================================

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
[EXPLAIN] What this step does
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Collects the results of steps 15-17, which ran in the TensorFlow environment, and turns them
  into the numbers used by         the manuscript: (1) how well the original notebooks and their
  re-implementation reproduce the published R2 values,         (2) how much R2 is lost each time
  one information leak is removed from the final model, with paired differences         over seeds
  and a bootstrap over test molecules, and (3) how the leak-free original network compares, fold
  by fold,         with the classical ensembles and the D-MPNN under the same corrected tests used
  everywhere else in the study.
